      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "If you're thinking about going with Solar Galaxy, think very carefully. The install went fine, sure - but the real nightmare starts AFTER they’ve taken your money. Good luck getting any sort of help if your system has a problem. Their post-install service is non-existent.Communication horrible. Emails ignored. Phone calls? They will answer the phone sure, but they just lie about everything and it's empty promises with every conversation. Every time you chase them, it feels like you're starting from scratch.It’s like they ghost you the second they finish the install. No ownership. No accountability. Just silence and frustration. Oh but they do harass you post install to provide them a 5 star google review which I did but have now updated.I wish I had never gone with them, and I’m warning you now - if anything goes wrong with your system, you’re on your own. Almost 2 months and still haven't had a technician attend.Avoid. Seriously.",
