      "review_description": "As everyone says, these guys seem to work out of a call centre, but they were competitive and they came when they said they would, and they installed the system. Any issues I have had, they have gotten back to me about within 24hours.Adam in sales took a lot of time to negotiate the right system for me and answered all my questions. Duc the installer was very good at explaining things and did a clean job with his team.They asked me straight away to review them on Google, but I said I wanted to wait a quarter before I did and at this point it all seems fine.There was an overheating alert on the Solarman app the other day when it was extreme temps. They advised me to install a small awning to keep it from direct sunlight. Other than that it tracks and generates expected yields.",
